  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil. Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 minutes, then remove the pan from the heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes.\n• Stir the plant-based butter through the rice. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65110ff5197e8b6c2f38298f-49e2537a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65110ff5197e8b6c2f38298f-d32fc8cf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot and capsicum, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm. TIP: Add a dash of water to help speed up the cooking process.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65110ff5197e8b6c2f38298f-d8d3b634.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are cooking, in a small bowl, combine plant-based Asian mushroom sauce, ginger paste and the brown sugar. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65110ff5197e8b6c2f38298f-7544c9f7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add mushroom sauce mixture and cook until slightly reduced, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65110ff5197e8b6c2f38298f-77a46edf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice, sticky tofu and garlicky veggies between bowls.\n• Drizzle with plant-based aioli. Sprinkle over crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65110ff5197e8b6c2f38298f-8990a3d9.jpeg"
    }
  ]
